      </div>

      <!-- Tab: About -->
      <div class="profile-tab-content" data-tab="about">
        <div class="profile-about-section">
          <div class="about-block">
            <h3>About Me</h3>
            <p>
              I'm a product designer with over 8 years of experience building
              digital products that people love. I specialize in user experience
              design, design systems, and data visualization. When I'm not
              designing, you'll find me hiking with my dog, experimenting with
              pour-over coffee, or writing about design on my blog.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-block">
            <h3>Skills &amp; Interests</h3>
            <div class="interest-tags">
              <span class="interest-tag">UI/UX Design</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Design Systems</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Figma</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Prototyping</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Data Viz</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Coffee</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Hiking</span>
              <span class="interest-tag">Photography</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-block">
            <h3>Experience</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Senior Product Designer</strong>
              at TechCorp &mdash; 2022 to Present. Leading design for the
              analytics dashboard team. Built a design system used across 12
              product teams.
            </p>
            <br />
            <p>
              <strong>Product Designer</strong>
              at StartupCo &mdash; 2019 to 2022. Designed the onboarding flow
              that increased user activation by 40%. Shipped 15+ features from
              concept to launch.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

